[00:22.22] There walked a lonely man
[00:25.61] Silent, mute, the only man
[00:28.41] Not knowing how not knowing why
[00:30.84] Was he the sole survivor
[00:33.96] Why should he be alive
[00:35.92] Breathing still while others died?
